  m_Name: Sandra
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DollConfig
  dollName: Sandra
  dollOwner: Ingrid Caple, 9 y.o, female
  dollStory: This doll was owned by young Ingrid Caple. It was found next to a lake,
    where Ingrid has tragically drowned. Despite Ingrid carrying Sandra everywhere,
    the doll was found tossed next to the lake. It was never discovered as to why
    Ingrid commited suicide, or if it even was a suicide.
  dollReason: There was no evidence to suggest that the doll was possessed. Further
    investigation into Ingrid's death revealed that she had gone swimming alone in
    the lake, carefully setting Sandra aside to keep her from getting wet. Tragically,
    Ingrid swam too far out and lacked the strength to make it back to shore, leading
    to her drowning.
